To be precise: the Wizard will keep returning if and only if one of
the following points are true:
* He has died,
* You have performed the Invocation Ritual,
* He is alive on the same dungeon level as you, and you have awakened
him from meditation.

His experience level has nothing to do with all this. Just for the
record: Each reincarnation will start out one experience level higher
than the previous one. Double Trouble does not count for this,
contrary to popular belief.


